        <div style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Welcome to the Department of Computer Applications</h3>
          
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            It is my distinct privilege to welcome you to the Department of Computer Applications at RV University. In an era where computational science drives every sector of human endeavor—from healthcare intelligence and financial systems to space exploration and environmental modeling—our department is steadfast in its commitment to cultivating future-ready software engineers and researchers.
          </p>
          
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            We believe that technical excellence extends far beyond traditional rote learning. Our pedagogy balances foundational rigor in algorithms, data structures, and computer organization with immediate exposure to cutting-edge tools: containerized cloud environments, artificial intelligence workflows, and defensive cybersecurity frameworks. 
          </p>

          <p style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            Our state-of-the-art laboratories provide an inspiring sandbox where undergraduate students do not merely read about technology; they build systems, architect databases, test network resilience, and deploy enterprise applications. Through our close alliances with leading industry partners, students benefit from live corporate hackathons, guest lectures by technology directors, and high-impact internships.
          </p>

          <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
            Above all, we strive to nurture ethical technologists who understand the societal consequence of code, prioritize user privacy, and champion digital accessibility. Whether you are an aspiring student, a research collaborator, or an industry partner, I invite you to explore our department and join us in shaping the computing landscape of tomorrow.
          </p>

